# Fusion Networking Rules

- Validate combat and state-changing actions on State Authority.
- Clients submit input only; never trust client-side damage outcomes.
- Keep authority checks explicit (`HasInputAuthority`, `HasStateAuthority`).
- Put simulation in `FixedUpdateNetwork`, not `Update`.
- Add lightweight debug logs for authority/path issues when needed.
